## External System Testing

### Import Testing

> **Note**: For comprehensive import testing guidelines, see `import_testing.mdc`. Use these patterns when testing import-related functionality, module dependencies, or import error handling.

### Subprocess Testing

> **Note**: For comprehensive subprocess testing guidelines, see `subprocess.mdc`. Use `pytest-subprocess` to mock external command execution.

```python
import subprocess
import pytest

def test_git_command(fp):
    """Example of subprocess testing"""
    fp.register(["git", "status"], stdout="clean")
    result = subprocess.check_output(["git", "status"], text=True)
    assert result == "clean"
```

